#: f4c08102fcb34a1da6824e2e24527338 f6bce84edd754089bacd8ce7d1c85d42
msgid ""
"Support for the XFRobot gimbals is available in ArduPilot 4.7 (and higher) "
"but some boards may require the 'HAL_MOUNT_XFROBOT_ENABLED' build option to "
"be enabled which can be done using the `Custom Build Server "
"<https://custom.ardupilot.org/add_build>`__"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 4.7（及更高版本）支持 XFRobot 云台，但部分飞控板可能需要启用 'HAL_MOUNT_XFROBOT_ENABLED' "
"编译选项，这可通过 `Custom Build Server <https://custom.ardupilot.org/add_build>`__ "
"完成"

